LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T184356Z
UID:165733-1777730400-1777741200@www.apsofdurham.org
SUMMARY:Crafts\, Drafts & Dogs
DESCRIPTION:If you’ve never been to Crafts & Drafts\, you’re in for a treat! And crafting with adoptable shelter dogs? Even better!! (Just keep them away from the paints\, please — it gets messy!) Crafts & Drafts has dozens of unique craft kits on offer\, and they’ll donate 10% of craft sales that day to APS. It’s a fun\, family-friendly way to while away a few hours on a Saturday\, and who knows — you might just fall in love with your new best friend too!
URL:https://www.apsofdurham.org/event/crafts-drafts-dogs-2/
LOCATION:Crafts & Drafts\, 3117 Guess Road\, Durham\, NC\, 27705\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adoption Events,Fundraisers
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.apsofdurham.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/0502-CD.jpg
END:VEVENT
