LAST-MODIFIED:20260423T193341Z
UID:165736-1778088600-1778095800@www.apsofdurham.org
SUMMARY:Out & About at Bull City Run Club
DESCRIPTION:On your marks\, get set . . . RUN over to Bull City Run Club to meet adoptable pups from APS! If running’s not your thing\, that’s OK! Go for a leisurely walk\, or just hang out with us and talk about dogs/cats/hamsters/bunnies — we love to do that! We’ll also have a raffle\, free swag\, and cool APS merch that can be yours for a small donation. Come on down and say hi!
URL:https://www.apsofdurham.org/event/out-about-at-bull-city-run-club-5/
LOCATION:Bull City Running Company\, 501 Washington Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Adoption Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.apsofdurham.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/0506-BCRC.jpg
END:VEVENT
